{"id":"u156","kelas":"toefl","no":1,"judul":"Mengenal TOEFL ITP","title":"TOEFL ITP Overview","emoji":"🧭","ringkas":"Format tiga bagian, skor 310 sampai 677, dan strategi umum","ready":true,"goals":["memahami **format TOEFL ITP**: Listening, Structure and Written Expression, Reading","mengetahui **jumlah soal, waktu, dan skor 310 sampai 677**","mengenali **tipe soal** pada tiap bagian","menyusun **strategi belajar** yang realistis"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"**TOEFL ITP** (Institutional Testing Program) banyak dipakai kampus dan lembaga di Indonesia untuk seleksi, kelulusan, dan beasiswa. Tesnya pilihan ganda dan berbasis kertas atau komputer di tempat. Detail dapat berubah, jadi **periksa penyelenggara resmi** sebelum mendaftar. Unit ini menjelaskan format yang umum."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Tiga bagian TOEFL ITP","table":[["Bagian","Soal","Waktu (sekitar)","Isi"],["**1. Listening Comprehension**","50","35 menit","Part A percakapan pendek (30), Part B percakapan panjang (8), Part C ceramah (12)"],["**2. Structure and Written Expression**","40","25 menit","Structure: melengkapi kalimat (15); Written Expression: mencari bagian yang salah (25)"],["**3. Reading Comprehension**","50","55 menit","5 teks akademik, 10 soal per teks"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[Total: 140 soal dalam sekitar 115 menit.]]","id":"Total 140 soal dalam sekitar 115 menit."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Skor dan strategi","table":[["Hal","Keterangan"],["Skor total","310 sampai 677 (dihitung dari tiga bagian)"],["Jenis soal","pilihan ganda; tidak ada pengurangan untuk jawaban salah"],["Listening","rekaman diputar sekali"],["Structure","cepat: sekitar 35 detik per soal"],["Strategi","jangan kosongkan jawaban; tebak bila perlu"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Bahasa akademik","text":"Teks dan ceramah TOEFL bersifat akademik (sains, sejarah, kehidupan kampus). Banyak kosakata dan struktur kalimat yang lebih formal daripada percakapan sehari-hari."},{"t":"tip","title":"Skor mudah naik di Structure","text":"Bagian Structure and Written Expression sangat berpola. Dengan latihan pola (subjek–kata kerja, paralel, jamak, tense), skor bagian ini sering naik paling cepat."},{"t":"summary","items":["3 bagian: Listening (50), Structure (40), Reading (50).","Sekitar 115 menit; skor 310–677.","Tidak ada pengurangan; tebak bila ragu.","Structure paling mudah ditingkatkan."]}],"practice":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa bagian pada TOEFL ITP?","options":["tiga","dua","empat","lima"],"answer":0,"exp":"Listening, Structure and Written Expression, Reading.","k":"94a24715"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa jumlah soal TOEFL ITP?","options":["140","100","200","50"],"answer":0,"exp":"50 + 40 + 50.","k":"6b79f5cf"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal pada bagian Listening?","options":["50","40","30","100"],"answer":0,"exp":"50 soal. Jawaban yang tepat: **50**.","k":"bb150fee"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal pada bagian Structure and Written Expression?","options":["40","50","25","15"],"answer":0,"exp":"40 soal. Jawaban yang tepat: **40**.","k":"c8ba63da"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal pada bagian Reading?","options":["50","40","30","20"],"answer":0,"exp":"50 soal. Jawaban yang tepat: **50**.","k":"ccdaed33"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa kisaran skor TOEFL ITP?","options":["310 sampai 677","0 sampai 120","10 sampai 990","1 sampai 9"],"answer":0,"exp":"Skala 310–677.","k":"6f5aff0b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa teks pada bagian Reading?","options":["5","3","10","2"],"answer":0,"exp":"Lima teks. Jawaban yang tepat: **5**.","k":"00fc681b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal tiap teks Reading?","options":["sekitar 10","sekitar 3","sekitar 25","sekitar 1"],"answer":0,"exp":"10 soal per teks.","k":"6f2b959a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal Structure (melengkapi kalimat)?","options":["15","25","40","10"],"answer":0,"exp":"15 soal. Jawaban yang tepat: **15**.","k":"aea4eb69"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa soal Written Expression (mencari kesalahan)?","options":["25","15","40","50"],"answer":0,"exp":"25 soal. Jawaban yang tepat: **25**.","k":"5e5a0a88"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part A pada Listening berisi...","options":["percakapan pendek","ceramah panjang","wawancara","iklan"],"answer":0,"exp":"Short conversations.","k":"d8264afb"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Part C pada Listening berisi...","options":["ceramah atau pembicaraan","percakapan pendek","dikte","lagu"],"answer":0,"exp":"Talks. Jawaban yang tepat: **ceramah atau pembicaraan**.","k":"47295b6d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Berapa kali rekaman Listening diputar?","options":["sekali","dua kali","tiga kali","sampai selesai"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sekali. Jawaban yang tepat: **sekali**.","k":"70faa793"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Apakah ada pengurangan nilai untuk jawaban salah?","options":["tidak","ya, satu poin","ya, seperempat poin","tergantung bagian"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tidak ada pengurangan.","k":"fc064b67"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian mana yang paling berpola dan mudah dilatih?","options":["Structure and Written Expression","Reading","Listening Part C","tidak ada"],"answer":0,"exp":"Berpola. Jawaban yang tepat: **Structure and Written Expression**.","k":"4d0417d4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pada soal Written Expression, tugasmu adalah...","options":["menemukan bagian yang salah","melengkapi kalimat","menulis esai","menerjemahkan"],"answer":0,"exp":"Incorrect part.","k":"6a49cd2f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pada soal Structure, tugasmu adalah...","options":["melengkapi kalimat dengan kata yang tepat","menemukan bagian yang salah","menulis ulang kalimat","menyusun paragraf"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sentence completion.","k":"b5ed5b03"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Topik teks Reading TOEFL adalah...","options":["akademik (sains, sejarah, sosial)","iklan","resep masakan","berita olahraga saja"],"answer":0,"exp":"Akademik. Jawaban yang tepat: **akademik (sains, sejarah, sosial)**.","k":"72e7bdf6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bila ragu pada satu soal sebaiknya...","options":["tebak dan lanjut","kosongkan","menyerah","meminta bantuan"],"answer":0,"exp":"Jangan buang waktu.","k":"7579f628"},{"type":"mcq","q":"TOEFL ITP biasanya dipakai untuk...","options":["seleksi atau kelulusan di kampus dan lembaga","izin tinggal luar negeri","surat izin mengemudi","ujian SIM"],"answer":0,"exp":"Institutional.","k":"c0f61171"}],"quiz":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Total soal TOEFL ITP adalah...","options":["140","100","200","120"],"answer":0,"exp":"140. Jawaban yang tepat: **140**.","k":"b6f66db6"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Skor TOEFL ITP berkisar...","options":["310 sampai 677","0 sampai 120","10 sampai 990","0 sampai 9"],"answer":0,"exp":"310–677. Jawaban yang tepat: **310 sampai 677**.","k":"344c7cfd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Listening terdiri dari...","options":["tiga part (A, B, C)","dua part","empat part","satu part"],"answer":0,"exp":"Part A, B, C.","k":"85606d81"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Reading terdiri dari...","options":["lima teks","tiga teks","dua teks","sepuluh teks"],"answer":0,"exp":"Lima teks. Jawaban yang tepat: **lima teks**.","k":"b31797c4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian Structure ada berapa soal melengkapi kalimat?","options":["15","25","40","5"],"answer":0,"exp":"15. Jawaban yang tepat: **15**.","k":"01c37d56"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian Written Expression menguji...","options":["mencari kesalahan","menulis esai","berbicara","mendengar"],"answer":0,"exp":"Written Expression.","k":"f14c364a"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pengurangan nilai untuk jawaban salah...","options":["tidak ada","ada","tergantung","sebagian"],"answer":0,"exp":"Tidak ada. Jawaban yang tepat: **tidak ada**.","k":"b6ae28ee"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Rekaman Listening diputar...","options":["sekali","dua kali","tiga kali","bebas"],"answer":0,"exp":"Sekali. Jawaban yang tepat: **sekali**.","k":"7fae489f"}],"read":[]}